{"unit_id":"RoderickWilliams__dsh-local-3d-studio#card-zh","repo":"RoderickWilliams/dsh-local-3d-studio","commit":"b86065f67adb5e45c12d7059d4886c1e7819d1f5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Local 3D Studio 是面向 DSH 的本地三维制作与模型处理插件，通过注册一组 studio 工具，把需求访谈、硬件与能力探测、方案管理、样例审阅和正式制作组织成工作流。它可以协调已有的 Blenderwright 等本地项目，也提供独立的 Three.js 通道，用于生成简单图元模型、查看和修改 GLB/GLTF、生成浏览器预览页及多视角截图。用户可记录文本、图片或视频输入，维护修订版，并在样例后决定是否继续制作。适合希望在 DSH 对话中管理本地三维资产和制作流程的用户。完整建模和媒体能力取决于本机工具及配置；Three.js 通道首次使用需单独准备其依赖。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:73-90","index.mjs:178-195","index.mjs:237-259","src/three.mjs:83-121"]}
{"unit_id":"RoderickWilliams__dsh-local-3d-studio#card-en","repo":"RoderickWilliams/dsh-local-3d-studio","commit":"b86065f67adb5e45c12d7059d4886c1e7819d1f5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Local 3D Studio organizes local 3D work in DSH, from capability checks and plans to sample review. Its tools coordinate modeling projects and use Three.js to inspect, edit or generate GLB/GLTF models, create browser previews and capture views. Local tools and dependency setup may be required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:73-90","index.mjs:178-195","index.mjs:237-259","src/three.mjs:83-121"]}
